@CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5178

### Providers (the "API" drop-down)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers
Accept: application/json

### Currencies offered by NBP (sorted per configuration)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers/NBP/currencies
Accept: application/json

### EUR -> USD for a period (200)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers/NBP/rates?sourceCurrency=EUR&targetCurrency=USD&dateFrom=2026-10-01&dateTo=2026-10-16
Accept: application/json

### EUR -> PLN for today (dates omitted; 204 on weekends and holidays)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers/NBP/rates?sourceCurrency=EUR&targetCurrency=PLN
Accept: application/json

### Table B currency - weekly rates (200)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers/NBP/rates?sourceCurrency=AFN&targetCurrency=EUR&dateFrom=2026-09-01&dateTo=2026-10-16
Accept: application/json

### Weekend - no data (204)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers/NBP/rates?sourceCurrency=EUR&targetCurrency=USD&dateFrom=2026-10-17&dateTo=2026-10-18
Accept: application/json

### Validation errors (400)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers/NBP/rates?sourceCurrency=EUR&targetCurrency=eur&dateFrom=2026-10-16&dateTo=2026-10-01
Accept: application/json

### Unknown provider (404)
GET {{CurrencyRates.Api_HostAddress}}/api/providers/ECB/currencies
Accept: application/json
